.TH "nvme_init_ns_mgmt_restore_default_config" 9 "nvme_init_ns_mgmt_restore_default_config" "October 2026" "libnvme API manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
nvme_init_ns_mgmt_restore_default_config \- Initialize passthru command to restore the default NVM subsystem namespace configuration
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B "void" nvme_init_ns_mgmt_restore_default_config
.BI "(struct libnvme_passthru_cmd *cmd "  ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "cmd" 12
Passthru command to use
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Initializes the passthru command buffer for the Namespace Management -
Restore Default Namespace Configuration operation
(NVME_NS_MGMT_SEL_RESTORE_DEFAULT_CONFIG). The NSID field is unused for
this operation and is cleared to 0h.
